  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The latest Update breaks Interactions for PCVR/Quest users when inside a VRC_Station when in a SDK3 World.\n\nThis is similar to the \"VRC_Station currently break in SDK3-Worlds\" Bug (https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1030-avatar-stations-non-functional) \n\nHow to reproduce?\n- Add a station twice the size of your avatar in front of you\n- go to a a vr player and let him try to interact with an object, gui (with the pointer thingies) \n- he won't be able to interact.\n\nThis bug/exploit currently works for PCVR users (tested with Vive Index, Oculus Quest in VD mode and Quest 1&2). Desktop players don't seem to be affected.",
